  "issue_comments": [
    {
      "body": "Closing this. We want every job, PR jobs included, to test on the newest image.\n\nThe gap it worked around is now short. On 2026-10-30 the rocm10 MI300 image was published at 11:45 UTC, and the runners' warm store switched at 12:26-12:28 UTC, so jobs pulled the image (~3 min each) for about 41 minutes plus a short tail. The warm store appears to refresh every 6 hours at about :26 UTC. We are asking the infra team to refresh it on publish instead.",
      "created_at": "2026-10-31T06:06:20Z",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/47360#issuecomment-6539892195",
      "id": 6539892195,
